---
// src/components/Trust.astro - Sección «Normativa y datos» (id="normativa") sin cajas pesadas
---

<section id="normativa" class="trust-section" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="container trust-container">
    <header class="trust-header" data-reveal="editorial">
      <div class="eyebrow-wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="eyebrow-text">NORMATIVA Y DATOS</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="trust-title" class="trust-title">
        Lo que pide el DeCA electrónico, de serie.
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="trust-grid">
      <div class="trust-col" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
        <h3 class="trust-col-title">El documento</h3>
        <ul class="trust-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>PDF nativo con código QR</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect>
              <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect>
              <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect>
              <path d="M14 14h7v7h-7z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Descarga directa desde el QR, sin usuario ni contraseña</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"></polyline>
              <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>No se emite sin los datos mínimos (tampoco sin matrícula)</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 20h9"></path>
              <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Modificaciones con su motivo y su historial, con el mismo QR</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 7 12 12 15 15"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Enlace disponible durante el transporte y siete días después de terminarlo</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-col" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
        <h3 class="trust-col-title">Tus datos</h3>
        <ul class="trust-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Servidores en la Unión Europea</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Copias de seguridad cifradas cada día</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Cada empresa ve solo sus cargas, transportistas y DeCA</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="trust-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            </svg>
            <span>Cada persona entra con su usuario y todo queda registrado</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-footer" data-reveal="card">
      <p class="trust-references">
        Referencias: Orden FOM/2861/2012 y Resolución de la Dirección General de Transporte por Carretera y Ferrocarril de 5 de junio de 2026 (BOE de 12 de junio de 2026).
      </p>
      <a href="/guia-deca" class="trust-guide-link">
        <span>Lee la guía del DeCA</span>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trust-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
    background-color: var(--palette-white);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    scroll-margin-top: 5rem;
  }

  .trust-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-line {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .eyebrow-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
  }

  .trust-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .trust-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .trust-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .trust-col-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    padding-bottom: 0.875rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border-strong, var(--palette-slate-300));
  }

  .trust-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .trust-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    padding-block: 0.9375rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
  }

  .trust-icon {
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .trust-footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .trust-footer {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
  }

  .trust-references {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .trust-guide-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .trust-guide-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand-hover, var(--palette-emerald-800));
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .trust-section {
      padding-top: 3.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
